title: Reset duplicate sync request counters after 60 seconds

doc:
  - audience: Node Operator
    description: |
      Duplicate block and state request counters now reset after 60 seconds from
      the first fulfilled response. Legitimate retries after sync restarts can
      therefore recover instead of remaining blocked by stale counters.

      Repeated requests now incur a smaller, non-fatal reputation penalty. This
      addresses cases where gap sync became stuck in a cycle of reconnecting to
      peers, retrying requests, and being banned again.

crates:
  - name: sc-network-sync
    bump: patch
